          "name_loc": "Sabatons of Mordiggian",
          "desc_loc": "<h1>Toggle: Mordiggian's Oath</h1> While active, grants +%unholy_bonus_damage% damage, +%unholy_bonus_strength% Strength, and +%unholy_bonus_armor% armor, and lets you move through units and turn more quickly with %phase_movement_speed%%% increased movement speed on melee heroes and %phase_movement_speed_range%%% on ranged heroes. Also grants up to %unholy_bonus_slow_resistance%%% slow resistance, scaling down with your current health percentage. Drains %unholy_health_drain_per_second% health per second.\n\nYou cannot die from the health drain, nor from the strength loss when deactivated. Movement speed bonuses from multiple pairs of boots do not stack.",
